Yggdrasil Cleave #11. A stand-alone tree: it carries its own store locators
(forensics/portable.py) and its own detectors, and it runs on the Python 3.10+
standard library alone. There are no third-party runtime dependencies, so
there are no third-party notices to carry.

Four detectors ship in this tree. The remaining 48 tools named in
forensics/home.py are not distributed here: they are resolved from a separate
azazael checkout named by AZAZAEL_HOME or found at ../azazael, and they are
covered by that tree's own licence terms, not by this one.
